Package: nitro-control
Version: 3.1.0
Section: utils
Priority: optional
Architecture: all
Maintainer: Erwin <erwin@local>
Provides: nitro-acer-fan
Replaces: nitro-acer-fan
Conflicts: nitro-acer-fan
Depends: systemd, python3, python3-pyqt5
Recommends: curl, ca-certificates, lm-sensors, dmidecode
Suggests: git, build-essential, linux-headers-amd64
Description: Universal Kali laptop fan/RGB/monitor control
 Works on any Kali Linux (or Debian) laptop:
 .
  * Auto-detects model via DMI
  * Fan control via NBFC when a matching config exists
  * Keyboard RGB on Acer Nitro/Predator (facer module)
  * Always: temperature, RAM/swap, SSD heat monitor GUI
 .
 Commands:
   nitro-fan probe
   nitro-fan-gui
   sudo nitro-fan install-nbfc
   sudo nitro-fan install-rgb
 .
 Formerly: nitro-acer-fan (Acer Nitro AN515-57 focused).
